  "name": "Physical Superiority",
  "type": "feat",
  "img": "icons/skills/melee/swords-parry-block-yellow.webp",
  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>At 3rd level, choose one of the following ability scores: Strength, Dexterity, or Constitution. You gain bonuses related to that ability score, reflecting your focus on physical excellence.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Strength.</strong> You gain a bonus to melee damage rolls and Strength checks equal to half your proficiency bonus (rounded up).</li>\n<li><strong>Dexterity.</strong> You gain a bonus to AC and Dexterity checks equal to half your proficiency bonus (rounded up).</li>\n<li><strong>Constitution.</strong> You gain bonus hit points per level equal to half your proficiency bonus (rounded up), and a bonus to Constitution checks.</li>\n</ul>",
